{"material_id":"mat_e326f358b155","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"v6j23p9krwwoxqvk05d9n0bfz","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"OpenRouter：Announcements（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"OpenRouter 发布 Agent 模型成本与质量权衡选型框架","excerpt":"OpenRouter 发布一个三步框架，用于为 Agent 任务选出以最低成本达到质量门槛的模型，而不是按排行榜排名选最高分模型。方法是先按任务设定质量门槛，再用 20 到 50 条自己的示例运行廉价、中档和前沿模型并用统一评分标准计算每质量点成本，最后选出以超过运行间分数波动的余量过线的最便宜模型。","source_url":"https://openrouter.ai/blog/insights/cost-vs-quality-tradeoff-framework-for-agent-models/","canonical_url":"https://openrouter.ai/blog/insights/cost-vs-quality-tradeoff-framework-for-agent-models","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-10-01T06:59:26.292Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"OpenRouter：Announcements（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_basics","ai_news"],"relevance_score":45,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":65,"fingerprint":"e326f358b155bc3e934f61ff313c6382040d2a5097cf339a58326f4fbe5f1381","content_fingerprint":"b7fe44373bb82ca3d5d35e8eb7a1aeb43cbfb5986eba3639adcac397ab0fdf8d"}
